# HR: Payroll calculator (simplified)

Load examples/hr/data/payroll_input.txt as Payroll Input

Find hourly rate and save as hourly_rate
Find hours worked and save as hours_worked
Find tax rate and save as tax_rate

hourly_rate equals 0 if hourly_rate == nil
hours_worked equals 0 if hours_worked == nil
tax_rate equals 0 if tax_rate == nil

gross_pay equals hourly_rate times hours_worked
overtime_hours equals hours_worked minus 40
overtime_eligible equals false

If hours_worked is greater than 40
  overtime_eligible equals true

tax_amount equals gross_pay times tax_rate
net_pay equals gross_pay minus tax_amount

gross_pay must be at least 1

Route net_pay to hr_payroll_queue
